{
"n": "#189·18",
"text": "A slip dress in lilac satin, this dress features delicate spaghetti straps and a plunging V-neckline that drapes softly over the body. Its midi length falls just below the ankle, creating a graceful silhouette that elongates the legs while maintaining a fluid, relaxed drape."
},
{
"n": "#46·31",
"text": "A tailored blazer in a rich chocolate plaid print, this structured piece offers a classic fit with notched lapels and front buttons. Its woven fabric adds texture and depth to the outfit while its clean lines provide a sophisticated balance to the softness of the satin dress."
},
{
"n": "#236·02",
"text": "Suede pumps in a deep forest green shade with a pointed toe and a low stiletto heel. The interior is lined with smooth leather, and the exterior has a velvety finish that catches the light subtly, making them ideal for an evening setting."
},
{
"n": "#131·31",
"text": "A vibrant lime-green leather handbag with a distinctive drawstring closure and thin shoulder straps. Its soft, slouchy shape gives it a modern touch, while the bright hue stands out against the more muted tones of the outfit."
},
{
"n": "#396·24",
"text": "Elegant hoop earrings featuring large, irregular pearls suspended from polished silver-toned hoops. The organic shape of the pearls contrasts beautifully with the geometric simplicity of the metal, adding a touch of understated glamour to your ensemble."
}
]
}
